# Only the public site, and what GitHub needs to publish it, goes into the online project.
# Everything else in this folder stays on this computer: PLAN.md, raw downloads, test pages,
# helper tools, the start file, and the satellite list (GitHub's job makes a fresh one).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/index.html
!/privacy.html
!/manifest.webmanifest
!/preview.png
!/icons/
!/img/
!/sounds/
!/vendor/
!/js/
/js/zoom-test.js
!/data/
/data/stars.json
/data/galaxies.json
/data/satellites.json
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/fetch-satellites.mjs
